+    //
+    // ROOT (live, W8, TWO titles, one bridge gap):
+    //   (a) Nextcloud 35.0.2 — the Dagger injector map iteration:
+    //       ImmutableMap$Builder.put ×272 (REAL Class keys, probe o334...)
+    //       → RegularImmutableMap.create(136, entries) ✓ → merge walks
