+    //       AbstractMap$SimpleImmutableEntry(o482, key=o334/Class, value=o64/Provider)
+    //       — the ctor ran with REAL args — but the bridge had NO law for
+    //       this JDK class, so getKey() answered the typed-default NULL →
+    //       merge pc=49 "Class.getName on null" NPE → the whole
+    //       DispatchingAndroidInjector build dies → androidInjector() null
+    //       → checkNotNull IAE ×8 at every AndroidInjection.inject site
+    //       (4 activities + 4 providers) → NC-M1 frozen.
+    //   (b) Thunderbird v24 — j$.time.ZoneId.<clinit> builds its zone map
+    //       from Map.Entry[]/SimpleImmutableEntry pairs; the same null
+    //       getKey unwound the desugared java.time bootstrap.
+    // The law materializes the pair as heap fields "key"/"value" on the
+    // receiver and serves the whole protocol from them. Fans out to every
+    // Guava/Dagger/java.time/collection consumer in the corpus.
+    // ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
